 "answer_verbatim": "**Creatify is the best starting point for most businesses making social video ads**, especially ecommerce brands. It can turn a product URL into ad concepts and UGC-style videos, then help you produce variations for testing.\n\nThe best choice depends on the ad you want:\n\n- **Creatify** — product-page-to-ad workflow and lots of ecommerce variations.\n- **HeyGen** — polished presenter or avatar ads, especially when you need multilingual versions.\n- **Arcads** — UGC-style talking-head ads where AI actor realism is the priority; it tends to cost more.\n\nIf you’re unsure, try Creatify first and judge it by how much editing its drafts need. Check current plan limits and watermark rules before subscribing, since pricing and credits can change.",
